# Jmix Security Rules (Cursor)

## Scope
Applies to `src/main/java/**/security/`

## Patterns
- `@ResourceRole` for entity/view/menu policies
- `@EntityPolicy`, `@EntityAttributePolicy`
- `@ViewPolicy`, `@MenuPolicy`
- Row-level: `@RowLevelRole`, `@JpqlRowLevelPolicy`, `@PredicatePolicy`

## Forbidden
- Hardcoded passwords/secrets
- Bypassing security checks

## Checklist
- Role code constant defined
- Entity policies set (CRUD level)
- View/Menu policies set
